From 3256534a58234ef692d3036958f8227f6b33b71b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: pugant <pugant@local>
Date: Fri, 21 Aug 2026 13:34:46 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] dflash: remove duplicate build_post_sampling call (framework
 hook suffices) [t8 stadio 2]

Phase-0 static review (independently confirmed) found that on DFlash2
graphs with a selector, build_post_sampling() ran TWICE per graph: the
direct call at the end of the graph<false> constructor (introduced by
ebf1cc855, whose message claimed the framework hook 'does not exist
here' even though it had landed the day before in ba2485545) plus the
framework-level hook in llama_model::build_graph (src/llama-model.cpp),
which reaches the same code via the virtual override. With no
idempotency guard the selector lattice was built 2x in the same graph:
output stays correct, but the duplicate wastes compute, doubles the
lattice nodes, and adds avoidable pressure on graph_max_nodes (DFLASH
sizing in llama-context.cpp).

Remove the direct call: the hook alone reaches
llama_model_dflash::graph<is_enc>::build_post_sampling() through the
virtual dispatch (build_arch_graph has a single caller, the framework
build_graph). The override's own guards keep the hook-only path safe
for every non-lattice case: is_enc graphs, embd/KV-injection batches
(early return leaves res->t_logits null), DFlash1/DSpark without
selector tensors, and dsv4 graphs (no override).

Verification (Vulkan gfx1151, Qwen3.8-27B STRIX_LEAN + DFlash2
drafter, T7 dual boot, D1 det prompt, temp 0, p_min 0.75, c 16384):
T1 smoke 14/14 on the rebuilt image; tg D1 3+3 runs mean 54.3 -> 54.1
tok/s (-0.5%, parity within noise, identical per-run draft counts).

Reference: phase-0 report, section 'Finding per lo Stadio 2'
(docs/research/2026-08-21-t8-fase0-session-report.md, lab workspace).

Co-Authored-By: GLM by z.ai <glm@z.ai>
---
 src/models/dflash.cpp | 5 -----
 1 file changed, 5 deletions(-)

diff --git a/src/models/dflash.cpp b/src/models/dflash.cpp
index 104a1d339..5136c551a 100644
--- a/src/models/dflash.cpp
+++ b/src/models/dflash.cpp
@@ -729,11 +729,6 @@ llama_model_dflash::graph<false>::graph(const llama_model & model, const llm_gra
     if (model.dspark_markov_w1) {
         build_dspark_markov_head(*this, model, inp_tokens);
     }
-
-    // DFlash2: build the selector lattice on top of the block logits. No-op for
-    // DFlash1/DSpark (no selector tensors), and skipped for embd (KV-injection)
-    // batches, which return above before reaching here.
-    build_post_sampling();
 }
 
 template <bool is_enc>
